      "**Rank-1 Outer Product Structures (Slides 381\u2013382):** Analyzing $B = A A^T$ for $A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times 1}$ with $\\|A\\| = 2$. Proving rank is 1, nullity is $n-1$, trace is $\\|A\\|^2$, non-zero eigenvalue is $\\|A\\|^2$, and establishing unconditional diagonalizability.",
