      "Complex Orthogonality: $v_1^\\theta v_2 = [1, i] \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ i \\end{bmatrix} = 1 + i^2 = 1 - 1 = 0 \\implies v_1 \\perp v_2$."
